---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="六角网（鸡网）— 规格、价格与安平工厂" description="六角网用于家禽养殖、石笼网与围栏。镀锌与包塑规格、网孔尺寸，安平工厂直供。" lang="zh">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <article class="flex-1 min-w-0 prose">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-theme-primary">六角网（鸡网）</h1>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary">六角网 — 又称鸡网、养殖网 — 由镀锌或包塑钢丝编织成六角形网孔。安平工厂大量生产，用于家禽围栏、落石防护、石笼网箱及园林用途。</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">材质与表面处理</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>丝径</th><th>镀层</th><th>寿命</th><th>适用场景</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>电镀锌</td><td>0.5–1.2mm</td><td>7–15 g/m² 锌</td><td>1–3 年</td><td>室内 / 短期</td></tr>
          <tr><td>热镀锌</td><td>0.5–2.0mm</td><td>40–60 g/m² 锌</td><td>5–10 年</td><td>户外围栏</td></tr>
          <tr><td>包塑（PVC）</td><td>0.8–2.0mm 芯丝</td><td>镀锌丝外包塑料</td><td>8–15 年</td><td>装饰 / 沿海</td></tr>
          <tr><td>高尔凡（Zn-Al）</td><td>0.5–2.0mm</td><td>95% 锌 + 5% 铝</td><td>15–25 年</td><td>石笼 / 海洋</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">常用规格</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>网孔 (mm)</th><th>丝径 (mm)</th><th>宽度 (m)</th><th>长度 (m)</th><th>用途</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>13</td><td>0.7–0.9</td><td>0.5–2.0</td><td>10–50</td><td>家禽 / 小动物</td></tr>
          <tr><td>20</td><td>0.7–1.0</td><td>0.5–2.0</td><td>10–50</td><td>兔子 / 园林</td></tr>
          <tr><td>25</td><td>0.8–1.2</td><td>0.5–2.0</td><td>10–50</td><td>鸡 / 轻型围栏</td></tr>
          <tr><td>40</td><td>1.0–1.6</td><td>0.5–2.0</td><td>10–50</td><td>石笼 / 落石防护</td></tr>
          <tr><td>50</td><td>1.2–2.0</td><td>0.5–2.0</td><td>10–50</td><td>重型石笼 / 水土保持</td></tr>
          <tr><td>75</td><td>1.6–2.5</td><td>0.5–2.0</td><td>10–30</td><td>大型石笼 / 河岸</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">六角网按卷重或平方米计价。<a href="/zh/tools/woven-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent">估算重量 →</a></p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">订货时需要说明</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>网孔尺寸（mm）—— 六角网不用 "目数" 表示</li>
        <li>丝径和表面处理类型（电镀锌 / 热镀锌 / 包塑）</li>
        <li>卷宽和卷长</li>
        <li>总数量（m² 或卷数）</li>
        <li>用于石笼时：需编织还是焊接网，以及单元尺寸</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">价格参考</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">产品</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">规格</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">价格范围 (USD/卷)</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">起订量</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">交期</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">电镀锌六角网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">25mm 孔，0.8mm 丝，1×50m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$8–15/卷</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 卷</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">10–15 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">热镀锌六角网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">25mm 孔，1.0mm 丝，1×50m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$15–28/卷</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 卷</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">12–18 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">包塑六角网（绿色）</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">25mm 孔，1.0mm 芯丝，1×50m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$22–38/卷</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 卷</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–20 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">高尔凡石笼六角网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50–75mm 孔，2.0mm 丝</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$18–35/卷</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50 卷</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–25 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">重型落石防护六角网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">40mm 孔，1.6mm 丝，高尔凡</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$25–45/卷</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50 卷</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">18–28 天</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted mb-6">*2025–2026 年参考价格。实际价格取决于镀锌量、钢丝成本、订单量及包装方式。请务必索取正式报价。</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">常见问题</h2>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">六角网和焊接网有什么区别？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">六角网是<strong>编织</strong>而成 — 钢丝相互绞绕形成六角形，柔韧性好，可贴合曲面。焊接网在交叉点焊接，形成刚性方孔或长方孔。六角网更便宜，适合曲面（石笼、养殖）；焊接网更坚固，适合平面板。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">镀锌六角网户外能用多久？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">电镀锌（7–15 g/m²）：1–3 年。热镀锌（40–60 g/m²）：5–10 年。高尔凡（锌铝合金）：海洋环境也能用 15–25 年。包塑在镀锌丝外增加美观和保护，但结构寿命仍取决于内部钢丝。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">六角网能做石笼网箱吗？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">可以 — 编织六角网是传统石笼材料。永久性结构建议用高尔凡或重型热镀锌，丝径 2.0mm+，孔径 50–75mm。焊接石笼（如我们的<a href="/zh/products/gabion-baskets/" class="text-theme-accent">石笼网箱</a>）更新型、更刚性，但价格更高。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">养鸡和养兔分别用什么网孔？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">鸡：25mm 网孔防天敌。兔子：20mm 或 25mm。小鸟/鹌鹑：13mm。园林防兔：25mm 配 1.0mm+ 丝径即可。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">包塑六角网对动物安全吗？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">安全，前提是涂层抗紫外线且不含铅。要求涂层厚度报告（通常 0.4–0.6mm PVC 包裹镀锌丝）。绿色和黑色是标准色；定制颜色需要更大起订量。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">如何计算需要多少卷？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">测量围栏长度 × 高度 = 所需 m²。除以每卷覆盖面积（宽 × 长）。加 5–10% 用于搭接和裁剪。使用我们的<a href="/zh/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent">集装箱装载计算器</a>规划运输。</p>
      </details>

      <div class="not-prose mt-8 bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="font-semibold text-lg">获取安平六角网工厂报价</p>
        <a href="/zh/inquiry/" class="inline-block mt-3 accent-bg hover:accent-bg font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors">发送询盘 →</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <aside class="lg:w-80 shrink-0">
      <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
        <!-- Quick Tools -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">快捷工具</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">计算与换算</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/woven-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 重量计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 集装箱装载计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/fob-price-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> FOB 价格计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/inquiry-template-generator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 询盘模板生成器
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Specs -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">快速规格</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">六角网标准</h3>
          <dl class="space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">网孔</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">13–75 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">丝径</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">0.5–2.5 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">卷宽</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">0.5–2.0 m</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">卷长</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">10–50 m</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">表面处理</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">电镀 / 热镀 / 包塑 / 高尔凡</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">标准</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">ASTM A641<br/>ISO 7902</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <!-- Related Products -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">相关产品</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">相关产品</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/gabion-baskets/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 石笼网箱
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/welded-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 焊接网
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/chain-link-fence/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 勾花网围栏
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Base>